  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>Подушки для стрел</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h1>О проекте</h1><p>Пусть стрелы (и жала пчёл) прилипают к большинству мобов, а не только к игрокам.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c94a0ac8e69905ead32ae0e96618f9d3eadf58d.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c94a0ac8e69905ead32ae0e96618f9d3eadf58d.png\"></p><hr><h1>Нужна помощь или есть вопросы?</h1><p>Вы можете связаться со мной через мой <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> (<em>предпочтительно</em>) или открыть проблему на <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">